```javascript
// Notify the observer that a shard has transitioned from unassigned to initializing
functions.RoutingNodesChangedObserver_shardInitialized({
  unassignedShard: "shardA",
  initializedShard: "shardB"
});
```

This single call will trigger the observer’s logic for handling the shard transition in your Elasticsearch cluster.

